// local one (CYRUS_PACK_STORE=local, or unset outside production). In production the public base points at object
// storage on an Nxeon domain and this route is never hit.
== app/api/admin/cyrus/ops/route.ts
// Cyrus R5 admin read model (JSON, no UI): recent deliveries (steps, rollbacks), Test Flight results, engine release
// records and per-version pass-rate counts. Read-only. Same gate as /admin/cyrus (role + "modbuilder" preview list).
== app/api/mod-builder/builds/[id]/live/route.ts
// Cyrus live code: the in-progress workspace of one of the user's running builds
// (src/main/** only, read-only, proxied from the build service's /live).
// `draft` + `from` ask only for the part of the file being written that the client hasn't seen.
== app/api/mod-builder/builds/[id]/install/route.ts
== app/api/mod-builder/uploads/route.ts
// Cyrus: one reference image pasted / dropped into the prompt (multipart field "file").
// Returns an upload id the create call can attach. The create route forwards the bytes to
// the build service (0.4+), which puts them in front of the AI (lib/cyrus/uploads.ts).
== app/api/cyrus/models/v1/projects/route.ts
// Cyrus Model Studio API v1: thin wrapper; logic + validation + gates in lib/cyrus/modelstudio/http.ts.
== app/api/cyrus/assets/v1/model-editor/route.ts
// Cyrus Model Studio L2 API: thin wrapper; logic + validation + gates in lib/cyrus/modelstudio/editor/http.ts.

